"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 99.289,
"end": 103.215,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1562,
"char_end": 1633,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 103.215,
"end": 106.231,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 1650,
"char_end": 1708,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 106.231,
"end": 108.623,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1709,
"char_end": 1755,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 108.623,
"end": 109.763,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1770,
"char_end": 1790,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 109.763,
"end": 116.948,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the race track sections change the choice of trajectory between practice runs and the actual race day.",
